add('c0813','skyroad-later-technology-restraint-zero','The Sky Road (the later restrained-technology civilization)','The Sky Road','The later low-industry order with preserved optical/nanotechnical expertise','Active living human residents of the later society','Actual scholarship and welding remain work; earlier political history and every hidden technology are not one public entitlement.',
'''Later people perform real scholarly and welding work while specialist tinkers preserve optical computing and nanotechnology. Technical capacity therefore coexists with restraint, secrecy and retained practical labor. The guarantee best guess is mixed and conditional because preserved expertise does not prove automatic equal necessities. This zero variant treats the alternative technical capacity as contextual, without declaring every current task unnecessary.

 Human community and specialist institutions receive positive control weight, with concentrated expertise and political authority inside the interval. Fear of computing does not establish either a universal robot ban or existing autonomous AI government. The low nonworking scenario counts scholarship, construction, cultivation, maintenance, administration, care and useful creation. Skilled work still counts when it is voluntary or culturally valued. Broad bounds preserve the source’s limited allocation account without converting low industry into lack of useful production. The selected later society remains separate from earlier narrative periods and any hypothetical unrestricted deployment of the tinkers’ machinery.''',
(.2,.5,.2),([-.9,.99],[-.6,1],[0,.95]),('Preserved expertise permits conditional support without equal automatic necessities proved.','Human community/specialist agency coexists with concentrated expertise.','Actual scholarship, welding and care count; restraint does not erase work.'),
['The review describes later scholarly/welding work and tinkers preserving optical computers and nanotechnology.'],['Ordinary provision and the depth of deployable automation remain estimates.','No universal ban or deliberate preservation of every unnecessary task is asserted.'],'Retain the technical-restraint comparison with actual human work visible.',regime=4)

add('c0817','permanence-rights-economy-zero','Permanence (the nano-licensed Rights Economy)','Permanence','The functioning proprietary Rights Economy','Active living human residents subject to nano-tagged object-use licensing','The general Cycler civilization is not assigned one identical licensing regime; enforcement is not universal provision.',
'''Nano-tags enforce payment for uses of proprietary information embodied in physical objects. Material capability can therefore coexist with pervasive access gates. The guarantee best guess is extremely weak because a usable object may remain conditional on permission and payment. Broad automated production is a contextual estimate beyond the directly described licensing mechanism, so the record is a zero variant rather than a sourced claim of universal automatic abundance.

 Human proprietors and institutions receive control near the concentrated reference point, with autonomous enforcement inside the interval. Software policing does not by itself make an independent AI the owner of everything. The low nonworking scenario counts production, design, services, administration, maintenance, care and useful creation. Licensing events and intangible trade volumes are not participation statistics. The point corrects the discovery’s broad Cycler label to the specific Rights Economy mechanism, preserving other communities’ possible differences without requiring their full reconstruction or importing a free material floor from technical sophistication alone.''',
(.95,.05,.25),([.2,1],[-.85,.75],[0,.95]),('Pervasive payment/licensing gates imply weak secure equal access.','Human proprietary authority coexists with autonomous enforcement.','Useful active roles remain; licensing events are not a labor census.'),
['The reference identifies the Rights Economy’s nano-tagged enforcement of proprietary object use.'],['General productive automation and household coverage remain contextual estimates.','Other Cycler communities are not assumed to share this exact regime.'],'Retain the specific technical licensing order with the broad discovery label corrected.')

